  "description": "A lightweight, dependency-friendly .NET reader/parser for ZIM (openZIM) offline archives (Wikipedia / Kiwix). Supports ZIM 5/6, the MIME list, directory entries, redirects, zstd/xz cluster decompression, binary search by (namespace, path), title-prefix search and a thread-safe LRU cluster cache. Pure C#, AOT / single-file publish friendly.\n一个轻量、依赖友好的 .NET ZIM（openZIM）离线归档（维基百科 / Kiwix）解析与读取库。支持 ZIM 5/6、MIME 表、目录项、重定向、zstd/xz 簇解压、(命名空间,路径) 二分查找、标题前缀搜索与线程安全 LRU 簇缓存。纯 C# 实现，AOT / 单文件发布友好。",
